design/case/case-architecture.md:155:5. Ring's charger starts on VBUS. The ring's USB device pulls D+ up: U1, as USB host, sees the attach and enumerates (full speed). No attach within 3 s: EN low, light amber blink 3 times ("turn the ring over": a ring flipped over is not blocked by the pocket at every size), back to sleep.
